      "entries": [
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_6f35a5d5397d88ec57a91c28d5ed4480",
          "content": "民事核验员可以说明相关利益，申请一份指定文书的副本。这并不代表可以查阅所有档案。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.civil_requests",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        },
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_19de4ee1637ee3fb5d0446035a87f254",
          "content": "共同体主持命名、婚姻和安葬礼仪。成为成员，并不等于担任圣职，也不意味着通晓深层教义。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.ordinary_rites",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        },
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_b6b8d84a761c240d88dc93dd1c22b5a6",
          "content": "官方记载提到，约四十年前东岸曾发生火灾、交通中断与电报失灵，之后进行了重建。这是官方的说法，尚不足以解释所有前因后果。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.public_history",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        },
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_9c40d98cd88fde037f5b8faea50ab1e9",
          "content": "索赔人须说明索赔对象，以及自己提出申请的依据。经济赔偿获准，并不意味着相关历史叙述都已得到证实。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.claim_procedure",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        },
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_515b4a10477c713789a00930debf9e64",
          "content": "分别询问见证人，记录时间，守住检验边界，不要随意移动相互矛盾的遗物或记录。若身份错位持续出现，应交由具备资格的机构处理。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.safe_inquiry",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        },
        {
          "knowledgeEntryId": "kentry_29bdd2d28034da884b976d483cde0191",
          "content": "城中有旧城区、市政区、交易区、大学区、工业带和码头。买了车票，也不意味着可以进入轨道或仓库。",
          "metadata": {
            "sourceDefinitionId": "knowledge.city_routes",
            "disclosure": "public"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
